{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Gunflare Epoch&quot;Demo</i> includes the first three chapters of the game, giving you a taste of its exciting gameplay, with a playtime of approximately 20-40 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full version will feature even larger levels, new weapons, and fresh gameplay mechanics to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Please note: Demo save data will not carry over to the full game.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Vast and Varied World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring 5 core story maps + 5 optional zones, totaling 10 unique stages for varied challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse rooms &amp; fully destructible maps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882590/extras/4722c61a73bb5d6e94836d35e7118724.poster.avif?t=1753627565\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882590/extras/4722c61a73bb5d6e94836d35e7118724.webm?t=1753627565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882590/extras/4722c61a73bb5d6e94836d35e7118724.mp4?t=1753627565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diverse Weapon And Item Synergies</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Offers over 100 unique weapons and 100+ distinct items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic Item Synergy System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882590/extras/b813a2922f6d7746bfd72b26e142d6bc.poster.avif?t=1753627565\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882590/extras/b813a2922f6d7746bfd72b26e142d6bc.webm?t=1753627565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882590/extras/b813a2922f6d7746bfd72b26e142d6bc.mp4?t=1753627565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rogue-Lite Headquarters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expansive base-building system for persistent upgrades and enhanced gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different characters also possess unique skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882590/extras/08f79fa847d64c8b89c32359a64932ab.poster.avif?t=1753627565\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882590/extras/08f79fa847d64c8b89c32359a64932ab.webm?t=1753627565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882590/extras/08f79fa847d64c8b89c32359a64932ab.mp4?t=1753627565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Vast Underground World to Explore</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore underground to collect coins and items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique black market for currency exchange.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882590/extras/42766348d1427f7301ec169a13574ca0.poster.avif?t=1753627565\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882590/extras/42766348d1427f7301ec169a13574ca0.webm?t=1753627565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882590/extras/42766348d1427f7301ec169a13574ca0.mp4?t=1753627565\" type=\"vi